Package: longcfa
Title: Helper for Longitudinal Confirmatory Factor Analysis
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Hok Chio (Mark)", "Lai", , "marklhc@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9196-7406"))
Description: 
    Simplifies the specification of longitudinal confirmatory factor analysis (CFA) using the `lavaan` package using a matrix-like approach, with indicators in rows and time points in columns. Supports longitudinal invariance constraints, continuous and categorical indicators, etc.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
